; claude: the browser around the page: a tab, its page, how it goes
; elsewhere (Browser_tab), the requests in flight over libs/network
; (Fetch), the history's two stacks (Browser_history), the developer
; tools' panels (Browser_devtools), the page zoom's levels and each
; site's (Browser_zoom), what is kept on disk between runs
; (Browser_profile), the right click's menu (Browser_menu).
(library
 (name browser_chrome)
 (wrapped false)
 (flags (:standard -open Network)) ; ours, not the Playground's (libs/network/dune)
 (libraries
   elm_playground ; Cmd: the tab's commands, its fetches carried as messages
   caps network
   logs ; -v: the files and URLs opened
   tiny_libs.core
   lang_json ; the profile's file
   mini_gui ; Gui_menu, the right click's menu
   lang_html browser_layout browser_url browser_display browser_www browser_viewers))
